# Happy Birthday (Harmonica)

A simple numeric harmonica arrangement of the classic birthday song.
Diatonic C

Positive numbers are blow notes.
Negative numbers are draw notes.

```
 6   6  -6   6   7  -7
 Happy birthday to you

 6   6  -6   6  -8   7
 Happy birthday to you

 6   6   9   8   7  -7  -6
 Happy birthday, dear 
                    someone

-9  -9   8   7  -8   7
 Happy birthday to you
```

=> index.gmi ← Back to song index.
